Description:
Add excitement to your celebrations with the Pack of 2 Snow Spray, perfect for parties, birthdays, weddings, new year events and other festive occasions. Each bottle contains 100 ml of good quality snow spray that creates a fun snowy effect, making your events more memorable. Easy to use and safe, this snow spray is a great choice for adding joy and entertainment to any celebration.

Key Features:

Pack of 2 snow sprays for parties and events
Net quantity 100 ml per bottle
Creates a fun snowy effect for celebrations
Good quality and easy to use
deal for birthdays, weddings, new year parties and more



