Delight your kids with the Musical Electric Lay Eggs Duck Toy – a fun, colorful, and entertaining toy they’ll love! This playful duck not only lays eggs but also features attractive lights, dashing music, and bump &amp; go action to keep children engaged for hours.
Made from fine-quality, durable materials, it’s safe for children’s health and designed to last. The bright colors, lively music, and fun movements make it a perfect gift for both boys and girls.
